From b0169b4d1b8b7934ebdd9c67a245667c5420117c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: maintainer <maintainer@camcraft.dev>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 09:53:36 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] fix(motion): check trochoidal clean-up engagement with
 step-down and advisory warning

Measures 2D and 3D Adaptive (Trochoidal) clean-up passes against the
post-lane stock across every max_engagement setting, steps down the
peel step along CLEANUP_LADDER when needed, and surfaces an advisory
Warning::EngagementExceeded if reduced steps still exceed the limit.

Fixes #3849
